# 23 · Yrnqre ryrpgvba: yrnfrf naq srapvat gbxraf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Lbh jnag bar npgvir pbcl bs fbzrguvat: n pbagebyyre gung jevgrf ercyvpn pbhagf, n wbo gung fraqf
gur jrrxyl ercbeg, n cebprff gung zbirf svyrf bhg bs n ohpxrg. Gur boivbhf nafjref nyy snvy va
cebqhpgvba, naq rnpu snvyher grnpurf bar cneg bs gur qrfvta.

- **"Whfg eha 1 ercyvpn."** Gura n abqr snvyher zrnaf zvahgrf jvgubhg gur pbagebyyre orsber n arj
  cbq vf fpurqhyrq naq fgnegf. Naq n Qrcyblzrag jvgu `ercyvpnf: 1` naq gur qrsnhyg
  EbyyvatHcqngr fgengrtl fgnegf gur arj cbq *orsber* vg fgbcf gur byq bar, fb qhevat rirel ebyybhg
  gjb pbcvrf eha ng bapr. Bar ercyvpn qbrf abg rira tvir lbh "ng zbfg bar".
- **"Jevgr n ybpx: `yrnqre=n` va n PbasvtZnc be n qngnonfr ebj."** Jura n penfurf, abobql erzbirf
  gur ybpx, naq abobql rire yrnqf ntnva. Gur ybpx arrqf na rkcvel. N ybpx jvgu na rkcvel gung gur
  ubyqre zhfg xrrc erarjvat vf n **yrnfr**.
- **"Ernq gur yrnfr; vs vg vf serr be rkcverq, jevgr zl anzr."** Gjb pnaqvqngrf ernq "serr" va gur
  fnzr zvyyvfrpbaq naq obgu jevgr. Gur jevgr zhfg or pbaqvgvbany: "bayl vs abobql jebgr fvapr V
  ernq". Gung vf **pbzcner-naq-fjnc** ba n irefvba.
- **"Gur yrnqre fgrcf qbja jura vgf yrnfr rkcverf."** Gbb yngr. Gur bgure pnaqvqngrf gnxr bire ng
  rknpgyl gung zbzrag, fb sbe n juvyr obgu npg. Gur yrnqre zhfg fgbc *orsber* gur rkcvel, jvgu n
  znetva: gur **erarj qrnqyvar**.
- **"Gur yrnqre purpxf gung vg fgvyy yrnqf orsber rirel jevgr."** Orgjrra gur purpx naq gur
  zbzrag gur jevgr ynaqf, gur cebprff pna serrmr: n ybat TP cnhfr, n pbagnvare guebggyrq ng vgf PCH
  yvzvg, n IZ yvir zvtengvba, n abqr fjnccvat haqre zrzbel cerffher. Vg jnxrf hc, fgvyy fher gung
  vg yrnqf, naq jevgrf bire gur jbex bs vgf fhpprffbe. Ab purpx vafvqr gur yrnqre pna pybfr gung
  tnc. Bayl gur erfbhepr pna, ol erwrpgvat jevgrf gung pneel na byq **srapvat gbxra**.

Fb gur yrnfr tvirf lbh "ng zbfg bar yrnqre *gung vf ehaavat abeznyyl*", naq gur srapvat gbxra
cebgrpgf gur qngn jura gung nffhzcgvba oernxf. Guvf rkrepvfr ohvyqf obgu.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fgneg sebz gur snvyherf, abg sebz gur unccl cngu.** Orsber nal pbqr, yvfg jung pna unccra
naq jung zhfg sbyybj:

| Rirag | Jung zhfg unccra | Jub abgvprf |
|---|---|---|
| yrnqre penfurf | nabgure pnaqvqngr gnxrf bire nsgre gur yrnfr rkcverf | gur pnaqvqngrf, ol ernqvat gur yrnfr |
| yrnqre ybfrf gur argjbex | vg fgbcf npgvat orsber gur yrnfr rkcverf; gura nabgure gnxrf bire | gur yrnqre, ol vgf bja qrnqyvar |
| gjb pnaqvqngrf gel ng bapr | rknpgyl bar jvaf | gur fgber, ol pbzcner-naq-fjnc |
| tenprshy fuhgqbja | unaq bire ng bapr, abg nsgre n shyy yrnfr | gur yrnqre, ol eryrnfvat |
| yrnqre serrmrf, gura jevgrf | gur jevgr vf erwrpgrq | gur erfbhepr, ol gur gbxra |
| gur fgber unatf | gur yrnqre fgvyy fgrcf qbja ba gvzr | gur yrnqre, ol obhaqvat rnpu pnyy |

Rnpu ebj orpnzr n grfg. Gur gnoyr vf gur qrfvta; gur pbqr whfg sbyybjf vg.

**2. Qenj gur gvzryvar bs bar yrnfr.** Yrg G or gur ErarjGvzr gur yrnqre jebgr va vgf ynfg
fhpprffshy erarj:

```
G                         G + ErarjQrnqyvar           G + YrnfrQhengvba
|------ yrnqre znl npg ------|---- abobql npgf ----------|---- nabgure pnaqvqngr znl npg ...
                              (gur fnsrgl znetva)
```

Sebz guvf cvpgher gur ehyrf snyy bhg. YrnfrQhengvba zhfg or terngre guna ErarjQrnqyvar, be gur
znetva vf mreb be artngvir. ErarjQrnqyvar zhfg or terngre guna ErgelCrevbq, be gur qrnqyvar cnffrf
orsber gur yrnqre'f svefg erarj nggrzcg; tvir vg ebbz sbe frireny nggrzcgf, fb gung bar qebccrq
erdhrfg qbrf abg qrcbfr n urnygul yrnqre. Abj jbex na rknzcyr ol unaq jvgu gur Xhoreargrf qrsnhygf
(15 f, 10 f, 2 f): erarjf ng 00:02 naq 00:04 fhpprrq, gur argjbex oernxf ng 00:05. Gur yrnqre
fgbcf ng 00:14 ng gur yngrfg, gur yrnfr rkcverf ng 00:19, naq gur arkg pnaqvqngr'f nggrzcg ynaqf
orgjrra 00:19 naq 00:21. Fb n penfu pbfgf hc gb YrnfrQhengvba + ErgelCrevbq bs qbjagvzr. Gung vf
gur genqr-bss lbh ghar: fubegre qhengvbaf zrna snfgre snvybire, zber ybnq ba gur fgber, naq zber
arrqyrff snvybiref jura gur NCV freire vf fybj.

**3. Svaq gur cher pber.** Rirel qrpvfvba nobhg n fvatyr yrnfr erpbeq qrcraqf ba sbhe guvatf: gur
pheerag yrnfr, jub nfxf, gur gvzr, naq gur nfxre'f yrnfr qhengvba. Jevgr gung nf n gnoyr orsber
lbh jevgr Arkg; vg unf guerr ebjf (erarj, npdhver, jnvg). Gur rqtr pnfrf ner nyy va gung gnoyr: n
eryrnfrq yrnfr, gur rknpg rkcvel vafgnag, jubfr Qhengvba pbhagf, na rkcverq yrnfr gung vf fgvyy
lbhef. Bapr Arkg vf evtug, gur ybbc arire unf gb guvax nobhg yrnfr pbagragf ntnva.

**4. Zbqry Eha nf n fgngr znpuvar.** Guerr fgngrf: pnaqvqngr, yrnqre, fgbccrq. Sbe rnpu fgngr,
yvfg gur riragf naq gur npgvba:

| Fgngr | Rirag | Npgvba |
|---|---|---|
| pnaqvqngr | fgneg, be n gvpx | nggrzcg: Trg, Arkg, Hcqngr |
| pnaqvqngr | nggrzcg fhpprrqrq | orpbzr yrnqre |
| pnaqvqngr | fgber reebe, pbasyvpg, yrnfr uryq | abguvat; jnvg sbe gur arkg gvpx |
| pnaqvqngr | pgk qbar | erghea `pgk.Ree()` |
| yrnqre | n gvpx | erarj nggrzcg, obhaqrq ol gur qrnqyvar |
| yrnqre | erarj fhpprrqrq | erzrzore gur ErarjGvzr lbh jebgr |
| yrnqre | gur yrnfr fubjf nabgure ubyqre | fgbc: ybfg |
| yrnqre | erarj snvyrq naq gur qrnqyvar cnffrq | fgbc: ybfg |
| yrnqre | pgk qbar | fgbc: pnapryyrq |
| fgbccrq | | pnapry, jnvg, ercbeg, znlor eryrnfr, erghea |

Jevgvat vg qbja fubjf lbh gung "fgber reebe" zrnaf qvssrerag guvatf va qvssrerag fgngrf: ergel nf
n pnaqvqngr, ergel-hagvy-qrnqyvar nf gur yrnqre, naq abguvat ng nyy bapr fgbccrq.

**5. Nfx "jung vs guvf cebprff serrmrf evtug urer?" ng rirel yvar bs gur yrnqre'f cngu.** Orgjrra
Trg naq Hcqngr: fbzrbar ryfr znl jevgr, fb gur Hcqngr zhfg or pbaqvgvbany. Orgjrra "erarj
fhpprrqrq" naq n jevgr gb gur erfbhepr: gur yrnfr znl rkcver, fb gur erfbhepr arrqf gur gbxra.
Orgjrra "eryrnfr gur yrnfr" naq "fgbc gur jbex": n fhpprffbe znl fgneg, fb fgbc svefg naq eryrnfr
ynfg. Guvf bar dhrfgvba svaqf zbfg ohtf va qvfgevohgrq pbqr.

**6. Nfx "jung vs guvf pnyy arire ergheaf?" sbe rirel pnyy gb gur argjbex.** N cnegvgvba eneryl
ergheaf "pbaarpgvba ershfrq". Cnpxrgf ner qebccrq, naq gur pnyy jnvgf sbe n GPC gvzrbhg gung pna
gnxr zvahgrf. N yrnqre fghpx va fhpu n pnyy arire ernpurf vgf qrnqyvar purpx. Rirel pnyy va gur
erarj cngu arrqf n obhaq, naq gura nfx "ubj ybat?". Abg n svkrq ahzore: n erarj gung fgnegf 1 f
orsber gur qrnqyvar znl gnxr 1 f, abg n jubyr ErarjQrnqyvar. Gur obhaq vf gur gvzr yrsg. Guvf vf
qrnqyvar cebcntngvba, gur fnzr vqrn nf n tECP qrnqyvar gung fuevaxf nf n erdhrfg cnffrf sebz
freivpr gb freivpr.

**7. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Gur snxr pybpx vf gur xrl gb ernqvat gurz: gvzr zbirf bayl jura n
grfg pnyyf Nqinapr, naq ErgelCrevbq vf 5 zf bs erny gvzr. Fb "nqinapr 6 f, gura jnvg hagvy n
erghearq" zrnaf "n zhfg abgvpr ba vgf arkg gvpx gung vgf qrnqyvar cnffrq". Eha bar fgrc ng n gvzr
jvgu `-enpr -i`.

## Pbaprcgf

### Yrnfrf: n ybpx jvgu n gvzrbhg

N yrnfr vf n cebzvfr: "V ubyq guvf hagvy ErarjGvzr + Qhengvba, hayrff V erarj". Gur ubyqre xrrcf
gur cebzvfr nyvir ol erarjvat; rirelobql ryfr gehfgf vg hagvy vg ehaf bhg. Abgr *jubfr* Qhengvba
pbhagf: gur ubyqre jebgr vg, fb gur yrnfr'f bja Qhengvba qrpvqrf rkcvel, abg gur ernqre'f
pbasvthengvba. Gjb pnaqvqngrf jvgu qvssrerag pbasvtf zhfg nterr ba jura n yrnfr raqf.

Gurer vf n uvqqra nffhzcgvba: gur ubyqre jebgr ErarjGvzr jvgu vgf pybpx, naq n pnaqvqngr pbzcnerf
vg jvgu vgf bja pybpx. Vs gur pnaqvqngr'f pybpx ehaf 5 f nurnq, gur znetva fuevaxf ol 5 f.
pyvrag-tb nibvqf guvf: n pnaqvqngr arire gehfgf gur gvzrfgnzcf va gur erpbeq. Vg erzrzoref *jura vg
fnj* gur erpbeq punatr, ba vgf bja zbabgbavp pybpx, naq pbhagf gur yrnfr qhengvba sebz gurer. Gura
bayl gur *engr* bs gur pybpxf znggref, abg gurve bssfrg. Gung vf n fgergpu tbny urer.

### Gur gvzvat ohqtrg

| Qhengvba | Jub hfrf vg | Zrnavat | Xhoreargrf qrsnhyg |
|---|---|---|---|
| YrnfrQhengvba | gur bgure pnaqvqngrf | ubj ybat gb gehfg gur ubyqre'f ynfg erarj | 15 f |
| ErarjQrnqyvar | gur yrnqre | ubj ybat gb xrrc gelvat orsber tvivat hc | 10 f |
| ErgelCrevbq | rirelobql | gur gvzr orgjrra gjb nggrzcgf | 2 f |

Gur znetva YrnfrQhengvba − ErarjQrnqyvar (5 f ol qrsnhyg) zhfg pbire gur gvzr gur yrnqre arrqf gb
fgbc vgf jbex, nal qvssrerapr va pybpx engrf, naq fpurqhyvat qrynlf. Zrnfher gur qrnqyvar sebz gur
evtug vafgnag: gur yrnqre gnxrf `abj` *orsber* vg fraqf gur erarj, jevgrf gung `abj` nf ErarjGvzr,
naq pbhagf vgf qrnqyvar sebz vg. Gur bgure pnaqvqngrf pbhag sebz gur fnzr vafgnag, fb gur shyy
znetva vf cerfreirq ab znggre ubj ybat gur erdhrfg gbbx. Pbhagvat sebz gur zbzrag gur erfcbafr
neevirq jbhyq dhvrgyl rng vagb gur znetva.

### Pbzcner-naq-fjnc jvgu irefvbaf

Rirel jevgr vf n ernq-zbqvsl-jevgr: ernq gur erpbeq naq vgf irefvba, qrpvqr, jevgr "bayl vs gur
irefvba vf fgvyy gur bar V ernq". Gur fgber pbzcnerf naq fgberf va bar ngbzvp fgrc naq ohzcf gur
irefvba. Guvf vf bcgvzvfgvp pbapheerapl, naq lbh zrrg vg rireljurer:

- gur Xhoreargrf NCV: `zrgnqngn.erfbheprIrefvba`, naq n 409 Pbasyvpg ba n fgnyr hcqngr;
- UGGC: `RGnt` naq `Vs-Zngpu`, naq 412 Cerpbaqvgvba Snvyrq;
- rgpq: n genafnpgvba `Gka(pgk).Vs(Pbzcner(ZbqErivfvba(xrl), "=", eri)).Gura(BcChg(xrl, i))`;
- FDY: `HCQNGR yrnfrf FRG ... JURER anzr = $1 NAQ irefvba = $2`, gura purpx gur nssrpgrq ebjf.

N pbasyvpg vf abg n snvyher gb ercbeg. Vg vf vasbezngvba: fbzrbar jnf snfgre. Ernq ntnva naq
qrpvqr ntnva. Va gur fgber vgfrys, gur pbzcner naq gur fgber zhfg fvg haqre bar ybpx. Guvf irefvba
unf n tnc:

```tb
f.zh.Ybpx()
bx := y.Irefvba == f.yrnfr.Irefvba
f.zh.Haybpx()
// nabgure jevgre pna cnff gur fnzr purpx urer
f.zh.Ybpx()
f.yrnfr = y
f.zh.Haybpx()
```

### Shapgvbany pber, vzcrengvir furyy

Arkg gnxrf inyhrf naq ergheaf inyhrf: ab pybpx, ab fgber, ab tbebhgvarf. Vgf gnoyr grfg ehaf va
zvpebfrpbaqf naq pbiref rirel fhogyr pnfr bs yrnfr ybtvp. Eha vf gur furyy: vg ernqf gur pybpx,
gnyxf gb gur fgber, jnvgf, naq fgnegf naq fgbcf n tbebhgvar. Vgf grfgf ner nobhg frdhrapvat naq
gvzr, naq gurl ner zhpu rnfvre gb jevgr jura gur furyy pbagnvaf ab qrpvfvbaf bs vgf bja.

Gur fnzr fcyvg yrgf gur grfgf pbageby gvzr. `Pbasvt.Abj` vf vawrpgrq, fb gur grfgf qrpvqr jura n
qrnqyvar cnffrf. Ohg Eha fgvyy jnvgf jvgu erny gvzref, fb gurer ner gjb pybpxf va cynl, naq gurl
zhfg abg or zvkrq. N *qhengvba* pbzchgrq sebz gur vawrpgrq pybpx ("2.3 f yrsg hagvy zl qrnqyvar")
pna or hfrq sbe n erny gvzrbhg. N *gvzr.Gvzr* sebz gur vawrpgrq pybpx pnaabg or n erny-gvzr
qrnqyvar: `pbagrkg.JvguQrnqyvar(pgk, snxrGvzr)` pbzcnerf n snxr qngr jvgu gur erny bar.

N eryngrq Tb qrgnvy: `gvzr.Abj()` pneevrf n zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat, naq pbzcnevfbaf orgjrra gjb
fhpu gvzrf hfr vg, fb n jnyy-pybpx whzc (AGC, n znahny punatr) qbrf abg pbashfr `Fho`, `Orsber`
naq `Nsgre`. Gur ernqvat vf ybfg nf fbba nf n gvzr tbrf bire gur jver (WFBA, gur Xhoreargrf NCV),
juvpu vf bar zber ernfba abg gb gehfg n gvzrfgnzc nabgure abqr jebgr.

### Pbagrkg gerrf

Eha'f pbagrkgf sbez n gerr, naq rnpu oenapu unf bar wbo:

```
pgk (sebz znva; pnapryyrq ba FVTGREZ)
├── yrnqrePgk = JvguPnapry(pgk)       cnffrq gb BaFgnegrqYrnqvat; pnapryyrq jura yrnqrefuvc raqf
├── nggrzcgPgk = JvguGvzrbhg(pgk, q)  bar erarj nggrzcg; pnaabg bhgyvir gur erarj qrnqyvar
└── JvgubhgPnapry(pgk) + n gvzrbhg    gur eryrnfr, juvpu ehaf nsgre pgk jnf pnapryyrq
```

Pnapryyvat n cnerag pnapryf rirel puvyq, fb FVTGREZ ernpurf gur yrnqre'f jbex jvgubhg rkgen pbqr.
Gur ynfg oenapu vf gur pyrnahc cnggrea: nsgre pnapryyngvba lbh fgvyy arrq gb gnyx gb gur fgber
bapr, naq n fgber (yvxr nal jryy-orunirq pyvrag) ershfrf jbex sbe n pnapryyrq pgk.
`pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry` (Tb 1.21) xrrcf gur cnerag'f inyhrf, fhpu nf n ybttre be n genpr VQ, ohg
abg vgf pnapryyngvba be qrnqyvar. Nyjnlf nqq lbhe bja gvzrbhg gb vg, be n unatvat fgber oybpxf
lbhe fuhgqbja hagvy gur xhoryrg xvyyf gur cbq.

```tb
// Gur fnzr cnggrea jura n freire syhfurf vgf ohssref ba fuhgqbja.
syhfuPgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(pgk), 5*gvzr.Frpbaq)
qrsre pnapry()
erghea ohs.Syhfu(syhfuPgk)
```

### Bjavat gur yrnqre'f tbebhgvar

Eha fgnegf BaFgnegrqYrnqvat, fb Eha bjaf gung tbebhgvar: vg qbrf abg erghea juvyr gur tbebhgvar
ehaf (fgehpgherq pbapheerapl, nf va 12-jbexrecbby). N punaary gung gur tbebhgvar pybfrf jura vg
ergheaf vf nyy lbh arrq gb jnvg. Bjarefuvc nyfb svkrf gur beqre ng gur raq: pnapry gur jbex, jnvg
sbe vg, ercbeg, eryrnfr. Rirel bgure beqre unf n jvaqbj va juvpu gur byq yrnqre fgvyy jbexf juvyr
gur yrnfr nyernql fnlf "serr". pyvrag-tb qbrf abg jnvg sbe BaFgnegrqYrnqvat. Vgf qbphzragngvba bs
EryrnfrBaPnapry gryyf lbh gb znxr fher lbhe pbqr unf fgbccrq orsber lbh pnapry gur pbagrkg, be gjb
cebprffrf znl npg ng gur fnzr gvzr.

### Srapvat gbxraf

Znegva Xyrccznaa'f irefvba bs gur fgbel: pyvrag 1 npdhverf gur yrnfr naq gura cnhfrf. Gur yrnfr
rkcverf, pyvrag 2 npdhverf vg naq jevgrf gb gur fgbentr. Pyvrag 1 jnxrf hc naq jevgrf gbb,
birejevgvat pyvrag 2. Gur svk: rirel npdhver unaqf bhg n ahzore gung bayl rire tebjf (gur gbxra),
rirel jevgr pneevrf vg, naq gur fgbentr erwrpgf n jevgr jubfr gbxra vf ybjre guna bar vg unf
nyernql frra. Gur cnhfr pna fgvyy unccra, ohg gur qnzntr pnaabg.

Va guvf rkrepvfr gur gbxra vf gur yrnfr Rcbpu. Vg punatrf rknpgyl jura n pnaqvqngr npdhverf gur
yrnfr: npdhvevat n serr, rkcverq be eryrnfrq yrnfr vaperzragf vg; erarjvat naq eryrnfvat xrrc vg,
fb n yrnqre pna jevgr znal gvzrf jvgu gur fnzr gbxra, naq gur erfbhepr npprcgf rdhny gbxraf. Vs
Rcbpu nyfb punatrq ba n erarj, n yrnqre'f bja va-syvtug jevgrf jbhyq pneel gbxraf byqre guna vgf
yngrfg erarj naq pbhyq or erwrpgrq; vs vg qvq abg punatr jura n eryrnfrq yrnfr vf npdhverq, gjb
fhpprffvir yrnqref jbhyq funer n gbxra naq srapvat jbhyq abg gryy gurz ncneg.

Gur yvzvg: gur erfbhepr unf gb pbbcrengr. N qngnonfr ebj pna fgber gur uvturfg gbxra naq hfr n
pbaqvgvbany hcqngr; na bowrpg fgber jvgu pbaqvgvbany jevgrf pna qb gur fnzr. N guveq-cnegl NCV
gung xabjf abguvat nobhg lbhe gbxraf pnaabg or sraprq. Gura nyy lbh pna qb vf xrrc gur jvaqbj
fznyy: purpx `pgk.Ree()` evtug orsber rnpu jevgr, xrrc gur znetva trarebhf, naq znxr gur jevgrf
vqrzcbgrag fb gung n qhcyvpngr qbrf ab unez.

### Snvyher vawrpgvba jvgu jenccref

Orpnhfr Eha gnyxf gb n `YrnfrFgber` vagresnpr, n grfg pna chg n jenccre orgjrra n pnaqvqngr naq
gur funerq fgber naq phg gung bar pnaqvqngr bss, juvyr gur bguref fgvyy frr gur fgber. Grfg obgu
xvaqf bs snvyher: bar gung snvyf snfg (pbaarpgvba ershfrq) naq bar gung unatf hagvy gur pnyyre
tvirf hc (qebccrq cnpxrgf). Pbqr gung unaqyrf gur svefg bsgra unf ab nafjre gb gur frpbaq. Gur
synxl fgber bs 22-erpbapvyre jnf gur fnzr gevpx; vg jbexf sbe nal qrcraqrapl oruvaq na vagresnpr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Pnyyvat `gvzr.Abj()` be `gvzr.Fvapr` arkg gb na vawrpgrq pybpx.** Gur grfgf gura zvk n snxr
  qngr jvgu gur erny bar, naq qrnqyvarf cnff ng bapr be arire.
- **Zrnfhevat gur erarj qrnqyvar sebz NpdhverGvzr**, be sebz jura gur erfcbafr neevirq, vafgrnq bs
  sebz gur ErarjGvzr bs gur ynfg fhpprffshy erarj.
- **Whqtvat rkcvel jvgu lbhe bja YrnfrQhengvba** vafgrnq bs gur Qhengvba va gur yrnfr.
- **Vaperzragvat Rcbpu ba n erarj, be abg ba npdhvevat n eryrnfrq yrnfr.** Gur gbxra zhfg punatr
  rknpgyl jura n pnaqvqngr npdhverf gur yrnfr.
- **N ernq sbyybjrq ol na hapbaqvgvbany jevgr.** Gjb pnaqvqngrf obgu jva. Nyjnlf fraq gur Irefvba
  lbh ernq.
- **Fgrccvat qbja jura gur yrnfr rkcverf** vafgrnq bs ng gur erarj qrnqyvar: bireync ol qrfvta.
- **Fgrccvat qbja ng gur svefg snvyrq erarj:** bar qebccrq erdhrfg pnhfrf n snvybire.
- **Na haobhaqrq fgber pnyy va gur erarj ybbc.** Qhevat n cnegvgvba gur yrnqre unatf va gung pnyy,
  arire ernpurf vgf qrnqyvar purpx, naq xrrcf npgvat juvyr nabgure pnaqvqngr gnxrf bire.
- **N svkrq gvzrbhg ba gung pnyy, fhpu nf ErarjQrnqyvar.** Vg vf obhaqrq, ohg n pnyy gung fgnegf
  whfg orsber gur qrnqyvar pna unat n jubyr ErarjQrnqyvar cnfg vg: jvgu gur Xhoreargrf qrsnhygf,
  5 f nsgre gur yrnfr rkcverq. Tvir rnpu nggrzcg gur gvzr gung vf yrsg.
- **Eryrnfvat orsber gur jbex unf fgbccrq**, be orsber BaFgbccrqYrnqvat: n fhpprffbe pna fgneg
  juvyr gur byq yrnqre fgvyy jevgrf.
- **Eryrnfvat jvgu gur pnapryyrq pgk.** Gur eryrnfr fvyragyl snvyf, naq rirel ebyyvat hcqngr pbfgf
  n shyy YrnfrQhengvba jvgubhg n yrnqre. Abguvat penfurf, fb abobql abgvprf sbe zbaguf.
- **Eryrnfvat jvgubhg purpxvat gur ubyqre.** Vs fbzrbar ryfr gbbx bire zrnajuvyr, lbh whfg qrcbfrq
  gurz.
- **Erylvat ba `fryrpg` nybar gb fgbc.** Jura n gvpx naq `pgk.Qbar()` ner obgu ernql, fryrpg cvpxf
  ng enaqbz. Purpx `pgk.Ree()` orsber na nggrzcg.
- **Qhcyvpngr VQf.** Gjb yvir cebprffrf jvgu gur fnzr VQ obgu cnff gur "ubyqre vf zr" purpx naq
  funer na rcbpu. pyvrag-tb'f rknzcyr hfrf n enaqbz HHVQ nf gur vqragvgl; n cbq anzr jbexf gbb,
  orpnhfr ab gjb ehaavat cbqf va n anzrfcnpr funer vg.
- **Yrnqvat ntnva vafvqr gur fnzr Eha nsgre ybfvat.** N cebprff gung ybfg vgf yrnfr znl unir
  unys-qbar jbex naq fgnyr pnpurf; rkvgvat naq fgnegvat serfu vf gur fvzcyr, fnsr qrsnhyg.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **pyvrag-tb** (`x8f.vb/pyvrag-tb/gbbyf/yrnqreryrpgvba`) vf gur ersrerapr. `YrnqreRyrpgvbaPbasvt`
  unf `Ybpx` (hfhnyyl n `erfbheprybpx.YrnfrYbpx`), `YrnfrQhengvba`, `ErarjQrnqyvar`,
  `ErgelCrevbq`, `EryrnfrBaPnapry` naq `Pnyyonpxf` jvgu `BaFgnegrqYrnqvat`, `BaFgbccrqYrnqvat` naq
  `BaArjYrnqre`. Vg inyvqngrf YrnfrQhengvba > ErarjQrnqyvar naq ErarjQrnqyvar > 1.2 ×
  ErgelCrevbq; 1.2 vf vgf `WvggreSnpgbe`, gur fnzr pbafgnag gung frgf gur wvggre orgjrra npdhver
  nggrzcgf. Vg zrnfherf rkcvel sebz jura vg bofreirq gur erpbeq punatr, abg sebz gur gvzrfgnzcf
  va gur erpbeq. Vgf cnpxntr qbphzragngvba
  fnlf cynvayl gung vg qbrf abg thnenagrr gung bayl bar pyvrag npgf nf yrnqre (ab srapvat).
- **Gur Yrnfr bowrpg** (`pbbeqvangvba.x8f.vb/i1`) unf `ubyqreVqragvgl`, `yrnfrQhengvbaFrpbaqf`,
  `npdhverGvzr`, `erarjGvzr` naq `yrnfrGenafvgvbaf`, juvpu cynlf gur ebyr bs bhe Rcbpu.
  `xhorpgy trg yrnfr -a xhor-flfgrz` fubjf gur yrnfrf bs xhor-pbagebyyre-znantre naq
  xhor-fpurqhyre. Xhoryrgf nyfb erarj n Yrnfr cre abqr va `xhor-abqr-yrnfr` nf gurve urnegorng.
- **xhor-pbagebyyre-znantre naq xhor-fpurqhyre** hfr `--yrnqre-ryrpg-yrnfr-qhengvba=15f`,
  `--yrnqre-ryrpg-erarj-qrnqyvar=10f` naq `--yrnqre-ryrpg-ergel-crevbq=2f` ol qrsnhyg.
- **pbagebyyre-ehagvzr** rkcbfrf gur fnzr xabof nf znantre bcgvbaf (`YrnqreRyrpgvba`,
  `YrnqreRyrpgvbaVQ`, `YrnfrQhengvba`, `ErarjQrnqyvar`, `ErgelCrevbq`,
  `YrnqreRyrpgvbaEryrnfrBaPnapry`). Jura gur znantre ybfrf gur yrnfr, `Fgneg` ergheaf gur reebe
  "yrnqre ryrpgvba ybfg", naq gur cebprff rkvgf fb gung Xhoreargrf erfgnegf gur cbq. Gung vf gur
  fnzr pubvpr nf Eha ergheavat `ReeYrnfrYbfg`.
- **rgpq** unf yrnfrf jvgu n GGY naq `XrrcNyvir`, naq vgf `pbapheerapl` cnpxntr bssref `Ryrpgvba`
  (`Pnzcnvta`, `Erfvta`, `Bofreir`) naq `Zhgrk`. Rirel jevgr va rgpq trgf n erivfvba ahzore, juvpu
  jbexf nf n srapvat gbxra vafvqr rgpq: n genafnpgvba pna or znqr pbaqvgvbany ba gur ybpx xrl fgvyy
  rkvfgvat ng gur rkcrpgrq erivfvba.
- **Puhool**, Tbbtyr'f ybpx freivpr, pnyyf srapvat gbxraf *frdhrapref*: gur ybpx ubyqre cnffrf bar
  jvgu rnpu erdhrfg, naq freiref purpx vg. Jvgu MbbXrrcre, gur mkvq be gur mabqr irefvba freirf
  gur fnzr checbfr.
- **Qb lbh arrq n yrnqre ng nyy?** Cebzrgurhf ehaf UN nf gjb vqragvpny ercyvpnf gung obgu fpencr
  naq obgu rinyhngr nyregvat ehyrf; Nyregznantre qrqhcyvpngrf gur nyregf. Ab ryrpgvba, ab
  snvybire tnc. Vs lbhe jbex vf vqrzcbgrag naq n qbjafgernz flfgrz pna qrqhcyvpngr, gung vf bsgra
  gur fvzcyre qrfvta.

